exports[`pretooluse.forbid-terms.blocklist.sh given: [case11] the blocklist holds a term that is not a valid regex when: [t0] a write trips no term at all then: the WHOLE message is snapshotted — a NEW human contract 1`] = `
"
💥 MalfunctionError: the blocklist holds a term that is not a valid regex

file: notes.md

the combined pattern failed to compile:
  \\b(deploy|kook(swell)\\b

what grep said:
  grep: Unmatched ( or \\(

fix: escape or remove the bad term in terms.blocklist.jsonc
     a term is matched as a regex, so ( ) [ ] | * + ? . \\ must be escaped.

this fails loud on purpose: a pattern that cannot compile would otherwise
permit EVERY blocklisted term with no signal at all.

"
`;

